      "copy": "Amplitude Studios releases Endless Space on 4 July 2012. Its turn-based space strategy places the player in charge of a civilisation within a galaxy of competing possibilities. Exploration, development, and strategic decisions operate at a scale far removed from an individual character’s journey.\n\nThe game belongs to the 4X tradition: explore, expand, exploit, and exterminate. Here, an imagined universe is expressed through relationships between resources, places, and choices. World-building therefore happens in the rules as well as in the illustrations.\n\nIts place in this room broadens the exhibition beyond cinematic adventures and open-world action. A French studio can work within an established international genre and still develop a particular identity. The history of the medium is full of these exchanges: inherited forms are adapted, systems are rethought, and a familiar set of verbs becomes a different invitation to play.",
